        },
        {
          "text": "Nao Jakobo ukacha kwa ndee Isaaka aja Mamre, (nigho Kiriath-araba, angu Hebroni) andu Abrahamu na Isaaka werekaieghe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
